gins/plan-executor/skills/implement-plan/dispatch-templates.md", "tests/scripts/test_plan_ops.py"], "orchestrator_note": "Binding re-review returned needs-rework but both findings are disputed. Finding 1 is empirically wrong: argparse mutex groups track explicit user presence, not default-value match (verified: bare --disagreement-tag works fine with current code). Finding 2 is a minor test-coverage nice-to-have. Per D.2a.6 step 4 (re-review binding), orchestrator must pause regardless; user decides disposition."}
